.superpowers/
/evidence/
/parent/
/tests/e2e/tmp-*.mjs
/joinModel*

# local private notes / secrets (never commit)
.local/

# Per-website local ops vault (credentials / brand assets; never commit)
# 例：websites/changanhanfu.com/
/websites/

# Site-specific design themes (local only; owned by websites/*/ vault docs)
# 长安汉服 → hanfu；DaoCharms → daocharms。勿入库。
/app/design/Weline/hanfu/
/app/design/Weline/daocharms/
